ich left it open for Richter. She easily won the gold medal over her teammate, " [:a {:href "/athletes/47550"} "Birgit Treiber"] ", with her only disappointment being that the world record stayed intact. Canadians " [:a {:href "/athletes/45791"} "Nancy Garapick"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/45768"} "Wendy Cook-Hogg"] " placed 3-4, as the top four finished in same places as they had at the 1975 World Championship."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "SF"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "112"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/47525"} "Ulrike Richter"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GDR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GDR.png"}] "GDR"]] [:td {} "1:03.61 (1 h5)"] [:td {} "1:02.39 (1 h1)"] [:td {} "1:01.83 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/47550"} "Birgit Treiber"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GDR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GDR.png"}] "GDR"]] [:td {} "1:04.34 (1 h3)"] [:td {} "1:04.21 (2 h1)"] [:td {} "1:03.41 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "43"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/45791"} "Nancy Garapick"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CAN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CAN.png"}] "CAN"]] [:td {} "1:03.28 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "1:03.75 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "1:03.71 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {:cl